# Source artwork that the site never serves. Everything here has a generated,
# web-sized counterpart that IS deployed:
#
#   Images/<category>/   ->  img/<category>/*-{480,960,1600}.webp
#   Home-Frames/, Frames/ ->  anim/home*/, anim/gallery*/
#
# Keeping these out takes the deploy from ~280 MB to under 40 MB. Regenerate the
# derivatives with tools/encode-images.py and tools/encode-frames.py.
#
# Every pattern is anchored with a leading slash. This file uses .gitignore
# syntax, where a bare name matches at ANY depth - an unanchored `Video` also
# matched Images/Video/ and dropped the showreel from the deploy.

/.vs
/tools

# Frame sequence sources (864x496 PNGs, ~51 MB)
/Home-Frames
/Frames
/frames with no background
/Video

# Camera-resolution gallery originals (~209 MB).
# Images/Logo.svg and Images/Video/ are still referenced, so they stay.
/Images/Banner
/Images/Branding
/Images/Creative Concepts
/Images/Display Stands
/Images/Exhibition
/Images/Giveaways
/Images/Packaging
/Images/Printing Materials
